Bilkul bhai. Tumhare role ko dekhte hue (BNP Paribas me Analyst), ye professional self-review comments use kar sakte ho:

1. Exhibit Technical and Analytical Competency

> I have actively worked on understanding the project architecture, business flow, and technologies used in the application. I completed assigned learning activities, analyzed code before implementing changes, and used AI-assisted tools where appropriate to improve productivity while ensuring code quality.



2. Work on Assigned Tasks

> I completed the assigned tasks within the agreed timelines, regularly shared status updates with my lead, and ensured that all code changes were properly documented and committed following team standards. I remained proactive in resolving issues and seeking clarification whenever required.



3. First Time Right (FTR)

> I focused on delivering quality work by thoroughly validating my changes before submission. I minimized defects through proper testing, followed coding standards, and considered the impact of my changes to avoid regressions.



4. Compliance to BNPP and Department Guidelines

> I adhered to BNPP policies, project processes, and security guidelines. I completed mandatory compliance trainings on time and collaborated with team members while continuously learning project-specific knowledge and best practices.



5. Communication Skills

> I maintained professional communication with team members, provided timely updates on my tasks, actively participated in discussions, and ensured that my communication was clear, concise, and respectful.



Overall Self Review

> During this review period, I have consistently focused on learning, delivering quality work, and improving my technical as well as communication skills. I completed assigned tasks on time, followed project standards, and actively worked on expanding my understanding of the application. Going forward, I aim to take ownership of more complex tasks, enhance my technical expertise, and contribute more effectively to the team.



Ye comments ek fresher/initial Analyst ke liye kaafi professional lagte hain aur mid-review me achha impression dete hain.
